<StaticPage title="About OGCTV" deck="OGCTV is being built as a modern local newsroom for Ogun State and surrounding communities."><h2>Ogun’s digital voice</h2><p>OGCTV publishes local news, public-affairs reporting, explainers, community stories and original video. Our purpose is straightforward: help people understand what is happening around them and why it matters.</p><p>This initial platform is a new newsroom product. It does not claim awards, audience figures, partnerships or credentials that have not been independently established.</p><h2>What we cover</h2><p>Our editorial structure supports breaking news, Ogun affairs, politics, government, business, education, crime and public safety, communities, entertainment, sports, interviews, features, opinion, announcements and video.</p><h2>How to reach us</h2><p>The verified contact available for this launch is the newsroom WhatsApp line: <a href="https://wa.me/2348062532830"><strong>0806 253 2830</strong></a>. No physical address, email address or social-media account is published until the organisation confirms it.</p></StaticPage>
